      7132,
      7854
    ],
    "title": {
      "en": "Great Tit or Chiffchaff?"
    },
    "text": {
      "en": "Both repeat two notes, but not in the same way. The Great Tit is loud and sawing, in a steady rhythm: \"tea-cher, tea-cher, tea-cher\". The Chiffchaff is softer and irregular: \"chiff-chaff-chiff-chiff-chaff\", the notes jump up and down at random."
    }
